*
!.gitignore
!fish
!fish/**
# fish rewrites this at runtime, and everything it held is set by
# config.fish (paths) or cachyos-config.fish (__done_*). Shipping a
# trimmed copy erased fish-pure-prompt's 76 universal variables.
fish/fish_variables
!ghostty
!ghostty/**
!scripts
!scripts/**
!scripts-manual
!scripts-manual/**
# Source for the login theme. Installed root-owned to /usr/share/sddm/themes by
# scripts-manual/sddm-noctalia; SDDM never reads it from here.
!sddm-theme
!sddm-theme/**
!niri
!niri/**
!nvim
!nvim/**
!lazygit
!lazygit/**
!systemd
!systemd/**
!noctalia-plugins
!noctalia-plugins/**
!noctalia
!noctalia/config.toml
# noctalia reads this as live config and reloads within a second of it changing.
# Track it, edit it by hand, but never have a script write to it.
!noctalia/settings.toml
systemd/user/*.wants/
